WEBVTT

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.933
Welcome, tutor, and thank you for helping our learners.

00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:14.106
The ARAL Gain Tracker is the app we use to see how much your learners improve in numeracy and in reading.

00:00:14.106 --> 00:00:18.162
At the start, you give each learner a short test, called the pretest.

00:00:18.162 --> 00:00:22.336
During the program, you record what each learner does in every session.

00:00:22.336 --> 00:00:24.334
At the end, you give the posttest.

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:28.508
The app then shows the gain for each learner, and for your whole group.

00:00:29.308 --> 00:00:32.608
Please remember that tutors use three separate things.

00:00:32.608 --> 00:00:36.214
First, the registration and attendance form of your school.

00:00:36.214 --> 00:00:38.659
Second, this app, the ARAL Gain Tracker.

00:00:38.659 --> 00:00:44.771
And third, the ARAL Tutor Engagement App, where you record your daily time and your accomplishments.

00:00:44.771 --> 00:00:47.765
This video series is only about the Gain Tracker.

00:00:47.765 --> 00:00:54.183
You can open the Engagement App from the Account tab of this app, and its link is also on the video page.

00:00:54.983 --> 00:00:58.022
You can use the app on a cellphone or on a laptop.

00:00:58.022 --> 00:01:00.393
Just open the app link in your browser.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:07.505
Everything you enter is saved on your device first, and it is sent to your district sheet whenever there is a signal.

00:01:07.505 --> 00:01:10.727
So you can keep working even when the signal is weak.

00:01:11.527 --> 00:01:14.719
Learner names stay in your district's Google Sheet.

00:01:14.719 --> 00:01:18.412
Reports for the division use learner codes only, not names.

00:01:18.412 --> 00:01:25.799
Keep your PIN private, never share your sign in with other people, and do not share learner names outside the program.

00:01:26.599 --> 00:01:43.386
In the next videos, you will learn how to register and sign in, add your learners, give the numeracy and reading pretests, understand the results, record your daily sessions for math and reading, give the posttest and read your report, and send your data safely, even without a signal.

00:01:43.386 --> 00:01:46.037
You can watch these videos again at any time.

00:01:46.037 --> 00:01:49.806
Tap, Video tutorials, on the sign in page or in the Account tab.

00:01:49.806 --> 00:01:50.513
Let's begin.
